1
00:00:00,910 --> 00:00:04,490
Let's see who wants to drive me away. I have Jiang family seeds in my belly

2
00:00:07,660 --> 00:00:12,560
This is your grandson. How could you bear to let her drift outside?

3
00:00:12,560 --> 00:00:16,079
Stop pretending here. At your age, how could you possibly be able to get pregnant?

4
00:00:16,079 --> 00:00:21,220
This is a hospital. How could I lie? Your mom, your son is begging for a good year

5
00:00:21,220 --> 00:00:24,740
I'll be crippled too, but the child is the Jiang family's only heir

6
00:00:24,740 --> 00:00:28,480
In my previous life, I was killed after inheriting the affair between my husband and Bao's mother

7
00:00:28,480 --> 00:00:31,760
In this life, I will make your family pay for their blood debts

8
00:00:31,760 --> 00:00:35,650
Later, he helped me wash my feet

9
00:00:37,190 --> 00:00:41,530
Zhang Guifang, don't go too far, my precious son said

10
00:00:41,530 --> 00:00:44,970
He wanted his grandmother to personally serve him, but if he didn't do it well

11
00:00:44,970 --> 00:00:48,330
He didn't come out, just sat inside and watched who was anxious

12
00:00:51,500 --> 00:00:55,900
You and Old Zhang, wife, wife, calm down

13
00:00:55,900 --> 00:01:02,280
Be careful of the child in his belly. It's not because of your pregnancy. For the sake of our Jiang family's seeding, I would have kicked you out long ago

14
00:01:11,660 --> 00:01:16,320
No, this is really wrong. Jiang Chenggao's gaze was not the same as the one looking at his daughter-in-law

15
00:01:16,320 --> 00:01:21,360
Oh wow

16
00:01:21,480 --> 00:01:25,520
Chen Gang, be gentle. I'm carrying you in my belly, it's swollen. Don't press on it

